---
pagination:
  data: collections.markdownPages
  size: 1
  alias: item
permalink: "{{ item.url | markdownUrl }}"
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{%- comment -%}
  Markdown version of every page with `markdown: true` in its front matter,
  at the same URL with .md (see the markdownUrl filter). Converted from the
  page's rendered content, so it never drifts from the HTML. Pages with
  their own <h1> (podcasts) already open with a title and an intro.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- unless item.content contains '<h1' -%}
{%- assign desc = item.data.desc | default: item.data.description -%}
# {{ item.data.title }}
{% if item.data.tags contains 'posts' %}
Опубликовано {{ item.date | dateReadable }}{% assign tags = item.data.tags | where_exp: "tag", "tag != 'posts'" %}{% if tags.size > 0 %} · Теги: {{ tags | join: ", " }}{% endif %}
{% endif %}
{%- if desc %}
> {{ desc }}
{% endif %}
{% endunless -%}
{{ item.content | toMarkdown }}

---

Страница на сайте: {{ site.url }}{{ item.url }}
